<DocsLayout frontmatter={{ title: "GraphQL Reference" }}>
  <p>OpenSauce exposes a GraphQL API at <code>/api/graphql</code>. All requests require a Bearer token generated in Settings → API Keys.</p>

  <h2>Schema file</h2>
  <p>Download <a href="/schema.graphql"><code>schema.graphql</code></a> and load it into any GraphQL explorer:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/graphql/graphiql">GraphiQL</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://altairgraphql.dev">Altair</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Regenerate</h2>
  <pre>pnpm run generate-sdl</pre>
</DocsLayout>
